# Section 2's beats and captions from demo/demo_record.hex: an opening of 150
# frames, each beat's caption 90 frames before its press and shown 150 frames
# at least, a closing of 180.
from-record ../../demo/demo_record.hex
caption build a trading empire/across the stars
idle 150
caption probe the dark/to find new planets
idle 90
fold 118 307
caption colonize planets:/each one needs and makes goods
idle 90
colonise p32
idle 40
caption link colonies with slipways/so goods can flow
idle 90
slipway p32 p55
idle 50
caption end the year:/trade earns money and science
idle 90
year
idle 15
caption spend science on new tech
idle 90
research xenofoods
idle 44
caption slipways/press any button
idle 180
